              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஞாபகம் — ñāpakam — \"memory; recollection\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தாத்தாவுக்கு இப்போது ஞாபகம் குறைந்துவிட்டது. tāttāvukku ippōtu ñāpakam kuṟaintuviṭṭatu. Grandfather’s memory has weakened now."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஞாபகம் (ñāpakam) இருக்கிறது, I remember."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஞாபகம் (ñāpakam) is borrowed from Sanskrit jñāpaka, \"causing to know, informing\" (Monier-Williams); Tamil writes jñ as ஞ."
            }
          ]
        },
