          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மங்கு (maṅku) is native Dravidian (DEDR 4750), in the family of மழுங்கு maḻuṅku, \"to grow blunt or dim\"."
            }
